ides among Danish patients with cancer: 1971 to 1986</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>1992</year><volume>69</volume><fpage>1507</fpage><lpage>1512</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer||69|1507||bib25|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1540887</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Storm</surname><given-names>HH</given-names></name><name><surname>Engholm</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Relativ overlevelse for danske kr&#x000e6;ftpatienter diagnosticeret 1981 til 1997 og fulgt til &#x000e5;r 2001-en status. (Relative survival among Danish cancer patients diagnosed 1981&#x02013;1997 and followed to 2001 &#x02013; a status report)</article-title><source>Ugeskr Laeger</source><year>2002</year><volume>164</volume><fpage>2855</fpage><lpage>2864</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Ugeskr Laeger||164|2855||bib26|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12082810</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Storm</surname><given-names>HH</given-names></name><name><surname>Michelsen</surname><given-names>EV</given-names></name><name><surname>Clemmensen</surname><given-names>IH</given-names></name><name><surname>Pihl</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Danish Cancer Registry &#x02013; history, content, quality and use</article-title><source>Dan Med Bull</source><year>1997</year><volume>44</volume><fpage>549</fpage><lpage>553</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Dan Med Bull||44|549||bib27|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib28"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sundhedsstyrelsen</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Forslag til handlingsplan til forebyggelse af selvmordsfors&#x000f8;g og selvmord i Danmark (&#x0002b;bilagsdel)</article-title><source>(Suggestions for